@startuml
title Activity 06 - Submit Purchase Request and Reserve Budget

|Requester|
start
:Open saved draft;
:Review items, supplier and justification;
:Click Submit;
|Frontend|
:Validate required fields;
if (Complete and valid?) then (yes)
  :Build submitted payload;
  :POST workflow purchase-request;
  |Backend|
  :Authenticate requester;
  :Validate department and item amounts;
  :Check available department budget;
  if (Budget available?) then (yes)
    :Reserve request amount;
    :Set status = SUBMITTED;
    :Persist request record;
    :Create requester and reviewer notifications;
    :Send email notifications;
    |Frontend|
    :Refresh Review/Tracking list;
    :Show submission success;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Reject reservation;
    |Frontend|
    :Show insufficient budget;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Show missing-field errors;
  stop
endif
@enduml
